<title>DUBAI: Iran gas conference rescheduled for February.</title>
<headline>Iran gas conference rescheduled for February.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>An international gas conference to be held in Iran's free trade zone of Kish Island will now take place on February 16 and 17, the conference organisers said.</p>
<p>Iran's Institute for International Energy Studies (IIES) and Institute of Political and International Studies (IPIS) had originally planned the conference for January 19 and 20.</p>
<p>The conference is expected to be attended by ministers and officials from Russia, Iran, Qatar, Turkmenistan and Oman.</p>
<p>-- Dubai Newsroom, +971 4 6071255</p>
</text>
